<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>All but one Helibor interest</p>
<p>rates were steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Friday. The three-month rate was flat at 3.06 percent.</p>
<p>			February 28 fix    February 27 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	 3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	 3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	 3.06 pct		3.06 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	 3.14 pct		3.14 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	 3.23 pct		3.24 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	3.32 pct		3.32 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
